Package: verification-portal-client
Version: 1.0.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: morfinauth-client-service, mantra-iris-service, default-jre | openjdk-17-jre, xdg-utils
Maintainer: Verification Portal <ops@example.com>
Description: One-shot bootstrap for operator-side biometric verification
 Meta-package that brings up an operator laptop for the verification
 portal: pulls in the MorFin fingerprint daemon (`morfinauth-client-
 service`) and the Mantra iris service (`mantra-iris-service`), pins
 the portal URL as the system browser homepage via Chrome / Firefox
 managed policy, and installs a desktop launcher under
 "Verification Portal".
 .
 The portal URL is read from /etc/verification-portal/portal.conf at
 install time. Re-run `dpkg-reconfigure verification-portal-client`
 after editing the URL to refresh the browser policy.
